            <h2 class="fontWeight100">The original ask was to improve category discoverability by adding a new tab.</h2>

            <h2 class="fontWeight100">I reframed the problem: reduce operational friction so providers could naturally discover and manage inventory during existing workflows.</h2>


          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
