            <%- include(`${templatePath}/shared/txt_description_l`, {
              text:'Discovery features outside the core operational workflow are rarely adopted when the workflow itself already feels time-consuming.',}) %>
            <div class="marginLeft">
              <h4>· Providers already avoided inventory management because of time cost</h4>
              <h4>· Additional tabs created more navigation overhead</h4>
              <h4>· Discoverability separated from editing created another disconnected destination</h4>
            </div>
            <div class="spacingSmall"></div>
            <h2 class="fontWeight100">Embedding discovery directly into inventory management made category exposure part of routine usage instead of requiring intentional exploration.</h2>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="spacingMedium"></div>
    <div class="wrapper">
