              <h4>· Continuous context while filtering and updating items</h4>
              <h4>· Visibility into missing, underused, or unlisted inventory</h4>
              <h4>· Confidence in how listings appeared on the customer-facing storefront</h4>

            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
        <div class="Grid-cell">
