            <div class="marginLeft">
              <h4>· Forced repeated navigation</h4>
              <h4>· Hid products behind separate management layers</h4>
              <h4>· Reset provider context during routine edits</h4>
              <h4>· Broke the connection between management actions and storefront output</h4>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>


    <div class="spacingMedium"></div>

    <div class="wrapper">
